---
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
import Page from "../layouts/Page/Page.astro";
import { ClientRouter } from 'astro:transitions';
---

<Page
	title="Hello, and Welcome!"
	description={SITE_DESCRIPTION}
	url={Astro.url}
	generator={Astro.generator}
	site={Astro.site}
>
	<ClientRouter slot="head" />
	<p>
		Welcome to my collection of projects and random wittering of my thoughts, code, and experiences.
	</p>
	<p>
		Most of my coding is now hobby based, due to the nature of my role, and I am currently focusing on: somewhat machine learning with <strong>TensorFlow</strong>, fun frontend projects in <strong>React + Typescript</strong>, and programs in <strong>C#</strong>.
	</p>
	<p>You can checkout and view some of my most recent work:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>A clean Astro blog template @ <a href="https://github.com/PeterTognola/jamestognola">jamestogno.la</a></li>
		<li>Personalised Maps and Prints @ <a href="https://yorkprints.co.uk/">York Prints</a></li>
		<li>Privacy focused e-receipt platform @ <a href="https://loup.in/">loup</a></li>
	</ul>
	<p>
		If you like the website and want to copy it, feel free to clone it <a href="https://github.com/PeterTognola/jamestognola">from GitHub</a>.
	</p>
	<p>

	</p>
</Page>
